<pre class=metadata>
Title: Tab-Indented Document with Embedded Space-Indented Code
Group: test
Shortname: indent002
Level: 1
Status: LS
ED: http://example.com/indent002
Abstract: Testing that tab-indented docs do not infer a space indent size from embedded 2-space code blocks, and report tab counts in under-indented errors.
Editor: Example Editor
Date: 1970-01-01
Markup Shorthands: markdown yes
</pre>

<pre class=anchors>
urlPrefix: https://example.com/tabdoc/; spec: example
    type: dfn
        text: tabdoc-term; url: #tabdoc
</pre>

Link: [=tabdoc-term=].

* outer item
  * two spaces is not an indent in a tab doc
* under-indented at level 1
  two spaces is not enough
* outer for level 2
	* under-indented at level 2
	  one tab plus two spaces is not enough

